						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 4
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Pincer (14): thrust 1d+2 cutting (KYOS: 2d-1 cutting), Reach C-1. The scorpionfolk can either nip and let go or hold on and grapple the victim in addition to injuring him. Either is an attack that takes full hit location penalties – not halved for grappling. Treat this attack as a bite for these purposes (see Teeth on page 115 of GURPS Martial Arts for details). The pincers give +2 with tasks that require a firm grip (including climbing)."
				},
